cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this FMF Collatz manuscript or its verification scripts, please cite it as a density-and-reduction paper, not as a proof of the Collatz conjecture."
title: "First-Multiple-of-Four Coordinates for Collatz Growth Chains: Density Bounds and Pointwise Obstruction Reductions"
authors:
  - family-names: Mohammadpour
    given-names: Hamed
date-released: 2026-05-14
version: "2026.05"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - Collatz conjecture
  - 3x+1 problem
  - 2-adic dynamics
  - natural density
  - terminal-window counting
abstract: "This manuscript develops First-Multiple-of-Four coordinates for Collatz growth chains, proves natural-density and fractional-moment results, and reduces the first bounded-depth pointwise obstruction classes to explicit terminal-window counting problems. It does not claim a proof of the Collatz conjecture."
